EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. If you would like to take a few classes, but are not interested in completing a degree at ASU, you would be considered a nondegree-seeking student. I encourage you to review our nondegree admission policies at https://students.asu.edu/admission/nondegree.

If you have already completed a bachelor’s degree and are interested in taking a few classes, but not ready to commit to a graduate degree program, please review our nondegree graduate admission policies at https://students.asu.edu/graduate/nondegree.

Thank you,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
